# ==============================================================================
# OCTOR COMPREHENSIVE CONFIGURATION FILE
# ==============================================================================
# This file is your single source of truth for all configurations in the Octor platform.
#
# INSTRUCTIONS:
# 1. Copy this file to 'custom.env' (cp example.env custom.env)
# 2. Fill in the CRITICAL SETUP and API KEYS sections below.
# 3. Use './run.sh start' to launch the platform.
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. 🛑 CRITICAL USER SETUP (Required for Octor to Work)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Controls how external clients and internal components find the Web UI.
# The public domain name (DuckDNS recommended for VPS setups).
